antiated (both 0, so no extra corroboration) for POL-RD-08. The lifetime counters — prior_deviation_flags, prior_disputes_filed, prior_no_show_flags — are context only under POL-GEN-01 and grounded nothing.\n\nOutcome. FULL_REFUND of the whole contested amount: 20.66 is returned to the rider. The refund is not reduced by the platform fee (0.80) or the base fare (3.80); the uplift operates on charged_total. It does not exceed charged_total, is not below the de minimis floor, and is far under the POL-RD-10(6) ceiling. No driver compensation is payable: billed distance (14.4 km) is not less than the trace distance, so the POL-RD-04 shortfall limb does not arise.\n\nConfidence and next steps. The ruling rests on artifacts each carrying weight 1.0 (EV-GPS-02827, EV-TRIP-02827, EV-FARE-02827, EV-DPROF-02827), so the POL-GEN-02(2) cap is 1.0, above the 0.70 escalation floor; confidence 0.9. Because the monetary effect, 20.66, exceeds the 8.00 automatic-execution threshold, the ruling issues but the amount is held in the human queue for release (POL-GEN-05). Either party may appeal once within 30 days under POL-GEN-04."
